  "question": "Which viewpoint is nearest when considering the southwest direction of Thomson Park, Thunderbolt, GA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.050045 32.03109)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 202.5 AND 247.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
